<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>We are fellows of the Bridegroom</l><l>And our fasting days have ceased.</l><l>With the Bridegroom in His chamber,</l><l>Joyfully we keep the feast.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>We as virgins may enjoy Him,</l><l>Virgins simple, single, chaste.</l><l>Going forth to meet the Bridegroom,</l><l>Out from all the world we haste.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>We are guests by God invited</l><l>To His Son’s great wedding feast.</l><l>Brothers, sisters, hallelujah,</l><l>From religion we’re released!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
